{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>Cybertruck遙控模型車按1:10比例還原不鏽鋼稜角造型，採用PC材質車殼，尺寸56.5×25.0×20.5cm，定價1769元。該車搭載無刷電機、四輪驅動和獨立懸掛，配備2.4G遙控系統，最遠控制距離99.4米，內置11.1V 3400mAh鋰電池，最高時速60km/h，續航最長20分鐘，並配有陀螺儀防甩尾功能。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1111/09948fddffc28f5.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>2.5代特斯拉人形機械人擺件為1:10人形玩偶，尺寸5.5×18.2cm，由40多個零件組成，設20個關節點，可調整姿勢，定價199元，隨盒附帶電鑽、扳手和可拆卸頭盔等工廠主題配件。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1111/6302c74d63b2e6a.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1111/9e91e5892e4f899.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.240645+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:35:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:40:00.642754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:09.871457+00:00","content_hash":"ec75400942ef2505ada43680994dd6d806ba545dc0cf708d009a8cad8cdc21ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}